            </connector>
            <label>Converted Final</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Lead nurture cadence: first-touch Task, wait 3 days, warm up if still untouched, second Task, wait 7 days, then cool down unconverted leads and e-mail the creator.</description>
